flowchart LR
  %% Target architecture and division of development responsibilities.
  %% Solid blue: Config publication and deployment. Teal: business API use.
  %% Dashed: artifacts or contracts delivered by the Engine Platform.
  %% Orange: export of the approved logical Config and target deployment settings.
  %% User flow follows 01_user_system_l1: 1 設定與啟用 → 2 Ingest → 3 Inference → 4 Evaluation → 5 Export → 6 Deploy.
  %% A starts Frontend, Backend and shared D. D can start with no System Config; publishing E enables F.

  subgraph A["A · Retrieval Builder（DEV）"]
    direction TB
    FRONT["Builder Frontend · 依 Schema、Descriptor 與有效相依產生欄位和選項"]
    BACK["Builder Backend · 啟動時載入契約與元件目錄、連接 Config Store"]
    E["① 設定與啟用 · E · 已驗證的 System Config Revision"]
    subgraph D["D · 啟動初始化的共用 DEV Retrieval Runtime · 可零組 Config"]
      direction TB
      DAPI["Runtime API、Registry、Executor 與 Queue · 依 system_id 路由"]
      F["F · 發布 E 後啟用的測試 Retrieval System"]
      DAPI --> F
    end
    DEV["DEV 外部依賴 · Elasticsearch（資料／控制索引）、模型與 Remote API"]
    FRONT --> BACK
    BACK -->|"驗證並保存"| E
    E -->|"經內部管理 API 下發"| DAPI
    BACK -->|"② Ingest／③ Inference／④ Evaluation 批次 Query"| DAPI
    F --> DEV
  end

  subgraph B["B · Retrieval Engine Platform"]
    direction TB
    SCHEMA["System Config Schema · Component Descriptor 與動態選項規則"]
    LIB["Retrieval Engine Library · 驗證、組裝與執行"]
    IMAGE["共用 Runtime Image · Runtime API ＋ Engine Library"]
    LIB -->|"封裝"| IMAGE
  end

  subgraph C["C · FTEST／ENT 部署"]
    direction TB
    BUNDLE["K8s 部署 Bundle · 同版 E、Image 引用、目標環境綁定"]
    CD["⑥ Deploy · 使用單位以 K8s CD 套用"]
    subgraph DP["D′ · 獨立 Retrieval Runtime"]
      direction TB
      PAPI["Runtime API · 啟動時載入 E"]
      FP["F′ · 目標環境的 Retrieval System"]
      PAPI --> FP
    end
    PROD["目標環境依賴 · Elasticsearch（資料／控制索引）、模型、Remote API、Secret Vault、觀測"]
    BUNDLE --> CD
    CD -->|"啟動 Image 並載入 E"| PAPI
    FP --> PROD
  end

  SCHEMA -. "提供設定契約" .-> BACK
  IMAGE -. "啟動共用 D" .-> D
  IMAGE -. "同版 Image 啟動 D′" .-> DP
  E -->|"⑤ Export 通過測試的 E"| BUNDLE

  classDef builder fill:#ffffff,stroke:#aec2df,color:#172c48
  classDef engine fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c8c2e9,color:#253450
  classDef config fill:#eaf1ff,stroke:#88a9d9,color:#17365d
  classDef system fill:#ddf1ec,stroke:#78b3a4,color:#153c3b
  classDef infra fill:#ffffff,stroke:#a7cbbe,color:#2e4b45
  classDef bundle fill:#fff2e2,stroke:#e5b47c,color:#58381e
  class FRONT,BACK builder
  class SCHEMA,LIB,IMAGE engine
  class E config
  class F,FP system
  class DEV,PROD,CD infra
  class BUNDLE bundle
  style A fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#bbcee8
  style B fill:#f2effa,stroke:#d1c9e8
  style C fill:#edf7f2,stroke:#b6dace
  style D fill:#e6f3f3,stroke:#a0c2c5
  style DP fill:#e6f3f3,stroke:#a0c2c5
  linkStyle 4 stroke:#147e75,stroke-width:2.5px
  linkStyle 14 stroke:#af6217,stroke-width:2.5px
